'''Roary Fishpouncer can be found in the hut immediately inside the zone and on your right. ''Your Location is 630.53, -675.76, 17.05'''''

You say, 'Hail, Roary Fishpouncer'

: Roary Fishpouncer says, 'Rrrr... catching and prrreparing fish is my specialty. Perrrhaps you could fetch for me some [rrrare fish] so that I may demonstrate my skill? Rrrr.'

You say, 'What rrrare fish?'

: Roary Fishpouncer says, 'Rrrr... my most delectable dish is prrreparrred frrrom rrraw darkwater piranha. Unforrrtunately, the pirrranha only surrrvives in the murrrky waterrrs of the wicked Toxxulia forrrest. I will rrreward any brrrave fisherman who can brrring me some rrraw darkwater pirranha.'

''' You have been assigned the task 'Fish Dinner'. ''' <br>
Roary Fishpouncer, a telented chef of Kerra Village, would love your help acquiring fresh darkwater piranha meat, a key ingredient in his specialty dish.

=== Quest Stage 1: ===
* Step - Collect 1 Raw Darkwater Pinaha(s)
* Task - Kill darkwater piranha in the rivers of Toxxulia Forest until you acquire Raw Darkwater Piranha meat.

You must kill [[a darkwater piranha]] which is a rare spawn in the Toxxulia Forest River between the entrance to Kerra Island and the mainland. It will rarely drop [[Raw Darkwater Piranha]]. It's PH appears to be any large piranha in the river.
This is an uncommon spawn, with an uncommon drop rate. 

 You have slain a darkwater piranha!
 --You have looted a [[Raw Darkwater Piranha]].--

